WEBVTT

00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:05.705
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.142 --> 00:00:09.976
Todoke Message

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:19.311
'Itsudemo anato wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:20.590
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:28.631
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.631 --> 00:00:28.960
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.165 --> 00:00:36.367
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.739 --> 00:00:40.869
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:40.977 --> 00:00:44.970
Aruiteyuki koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.281 --> 00:00:49.377
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.552 --> 00:00:52.953
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:57.282
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.594 --> 00:01:01.428
Todoke Message

00:01:01.831 --> 00:01:09.931
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.373 --> 00:01:14.309
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.711 --> 00:01:18.511
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:18.982 --> 00:01:28.414
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:36.256
Lately, Saiunkoku's king,
Ryuki Shi...

00:01:36.399 --> 00:01:39.334
...has been completely absorbed in
writing up the draft to a certain bill.

00:01:39.402 --> 00:01:41.768
It seems that he's worked
right through the night again.

00:01:41.838 --> 00:01:43.806
All right. It's done.

00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:47.008
Now that this is finished,
I can finally go to see Shurei.

00:01:49.779 --> 00:01:53.374
I've been restraining my desire
to see her until this was finished.

00:01:55.084 --> 00:01:58.281
Since I have court during the day,
I'll have to visit her in the evening.

00:01:59.088 --> 00:02:01.818
This is what's commonly referred to as
an evening tryst, isn't it?

00:02:02.025 --> 00:02:06.553
With this letter, no doubt Shoka will be
more than happy to allow it!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:11.890
Good Things Come to Those Who Wait

00:02:17.407 --> 00:02:18.999
Hey, Princess.

00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:22.200
I thought the season for
visiting family graves was over.

00:02:22.345 --> 00:02:24.575
Why are you cleaning
the grave now?

00:02:25.315 --> 00:02:28.807
Tomorrow's the anniversary
of the day mother died.

00:02:29.652 --> 00:02:30.778
I see.

00:02:39.796 --> 00:02:43.095
- Ensei, do you have any family?
- I did. A big one.

00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:47.659
But when I was a kid, bandits broke
into our home and killed everyone.

00:02:49.372 --> 00:02:50.703
I'm sorry.

00:02:50.773 --> 00:02:52.468
It was a long time ago.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:56.376
But as for your mother...

00:02:56.446 --> 00:02:59.574
...she must've been very
responsible and good at cooking.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.084
She was responsible...

00:03:03.152 --> 00:03:05.985
...but she's probably not the
sort of person you're thinking of.

00:03:06.456 --> 00:03:08.583
She was about as inept as father.

00:03:09.292 --> 00:03:13.194
But she was really good
at picking fruit from the trees.

00:03:13.262 --> 00:03:15.560
That's supposed to be
a man's job, isn't it?

00:03:15.632 --> 00:03:18.226
She really liked doing
that sort of thing.

00:03:18.301 --> 00:03:20.132
She had fun with everything.

00:03:20.203 --> 00:03:23.263
She was always smiling, full of energy,
and played with me a lot.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:27.808
Since I was sickly, she would
constantly take care of me.

00:03:28.044 --> 00:03:30.205
Sickly?! Who was?!

00:03:30.279 --> 00:03:33.840
I was. I was very weak when
I was small.

00:03:33.916 --> 00:03:36.384
- You're joking, right?
- It's the truth.

00:03:36.919 --> 00:03:40.286
After mother died,
strangely, I got stronger.

00:03:41.391 --> 00:03:43.723
Your mom must've
protected you, then.

00:03:47.563 --> 00:03:50.589
That day, there was thunder.

00:03:51.634 --> 00:03:54.967
Mom was always full of energy
and in good health.

00:03:55.838 --> 00:03:59.638
And yet, suddenly... She'd been
laughing the previous day.

00:04:00.443 --> 00:04:06.541
I wasn't well at the time, but soon
after mother died, I got better.

00:04:08.017 --> 00:04:10.212
Your mom protected you.

00:04:12.055 --> 00:04:13.545
Don't try to hold it in.

00:04:18.961 --> 00:04:22.488
I sucked my mom's life out of her!

00:04:22.932 --> 00:04:24.297
Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:24.367 --> 00:04:27.427
Mother ended up dying
in my place!

00:04:31.007 --> 00:04:33.976
I hate summer.
And thunder.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.844
They take away everything
that I care about.

00:04:38.981 --> 00:04:41.176
If you're like this every time
summer comes...

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.445
...your mom will be crying
in her grave.

00:04:43.886 --> 00:04:47.083
It was summer when
I lost my family, too...

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.824
...but I like summer.

00:04:49.892 --> 00:04:53.191
Because I've got
so many important memories of it.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.659
What about you, Princess?

00:04:55.732 --> 00:04:58.030
I've forgotten that sort of thing.

00:04:58.434 --> 00:05:00.231
You can remember them.

00:05:00.303 --> 00:05:03.204
And when you do, no doubt,
you'll come to like summer too.

00:05:03.806 --> 00:05:06.297
It's about time for you
to grow up, too.

00:05:07.577 --> 00:05:11.308
Making everyone around you worry
just shows that you're still a child.

00:05:11.681 --> 00:05:14.650
Now that you've cried about this
with me, you can, can't you?

00:05:16.819 --> 00:05:19.982
You're a very kind, strict, person.

00:05:20.523 --> 00:05:22.684
It's part of being a good man.

00:05:24.727 --> 00:05:26.991
Say that after shaving
this unruly beard.

00:05:28.264 --> 00:05:30.926
Not being able to appreciate
this wild appeal...

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.332
...shows once again that
you're still very much a child.

00:05:33.402 --> 00:05:34.664
By tomorrow.

00:05:35.805 --> 00:05:38.740
I'll be better by the anniversary
of mother's death.

00:05:39.142 --> 00:05:40.370
I promise.

00:05:42.745 --> 00:05:45.578
You've taken one step closer to
becoming a good woman, Princess.

00:05:48.518 --> 00:05:49.746
Koyu.

00:05:50.153 --> 00:05:53.088
I've finished reviewing
this letter.

00:05:53.156 --> 00:05:54.919
Now, which one's next?

00:05:55.291 --> 00:05:57.623
He's in a strangely good mood,
isn't he?

00:05:57.693 --> 00:05:59.285
It's creepy, isn't it?

00:05:59.362 --> 00:06:00.624
Koyu.

00:06:00.897 --> 00:06:04.230
Your Majesty, you haven't eaten
anything strange, have you?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.200
Like mushrooms
growing who knows where...

00:06:06.269 --> 00:06:09.295
...or some suspicious plant,
or bugs, or garbage?

00:06:09.806 --> 00:06:11.774
What do you take me for?

00:06:13.376 --> 00:06:16.243
I'm gonna carry out
an evening tryst tonight.

00:06:16.712 --> 00:06:17.906
An evening tryst?!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.174
Indeed.

00:06:19.415 --> 00:06:23.613
I wrote Shoka on the matter,
and he replied that it would be all right.

00:06:23.953 --> 00:06:26.285
If I may ask,
what did you write in your letter?

00:06:26.355 --> 00:06:30.451
"I'll come by in the evening. If possible,
I'd like Shurei to prepare me a meal."

00:06:30.526 --> 00:06:32.289
"I'd also like to hear her
play the erhu."

00:06:32.361 --> 00:06:35.660
"I would truly appreciate it if I could
spend an evening with you and Seiran."

00:06:35.731 --> 00:06:38.723
"I'm free four nights hence.
Let me know if it would be okay."

00:06:39.368 --> 00:06:40.835
That's not a tryst at all!

00:06:40.903 --> 00:06:43.963
It's no more than a simple visit
to someone's home, Your Majesty.

00:06:45.541 --> 00:06:48.305
Can I assume from the fact that
Your Majesty is visiting Shurei...

00:06:48.377 --> 00:06:51.312
...that the draft is complete?
- Yes, I finished it.

00:06:51.647 --> 00:06:55.981
I see. But, if you want to have
Lady Shurei by your side...

00:06:56.185 --> 00:06:59.848
...how about formally demanding
that she enter the Royal Residence?

00:07:00.456 --> 00:07:03.323
Shurei left the Royal Residence
of her own will.

00:07:03.626 --> 00:07:07.187
If I forced her to return,
no doubt she'd get angry.

00:07:07.463 --> 00:07:10.330
You've been in trouble with her
many times before.

00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:13.533
I feel like this would be different.

00:07:14.604 --> 00:07:17.664
If I did that, I get the feeling that
something would end up breaking.

00:07:18.374 --> 00:07:20.342
How well you understand.

00:07:22.311 --> 00:07:24.802
Well, hang in there.

00:07:24.881 --> 00:07:27.475
You have a lot of potential.

00:07:29.151 --> 00:07:34.145
This room's rather lonely
without those two, isn't it, Hoju?

00:07:34.523 --> 00:07:37.219
- Don't call me by that name.
- Why not?

00:07:37.293 --> 00:07:39.352
It's only the two of us here.

00:07:40.162 --> 00:07:44.622
Can't we ask Assistant Secretary Ri
to keep them here permanently?

00:07:44.934 --> 00:07:47.869
While it may not be possible
for Ensei to stay, hopefully Shu can.

00:07:47.937 --> 00:07:49.495
That won't be possible.

00:07:49.572 --> 00:07:50.800
Why's that?

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.706
Have you really not figured it out yet?

00:07:53.943 --> 00:07:55.740
Huh? About what?

00:07:55.811 --> 00:07:57.779
- They went that way!
- Get them!

00:08:01.817 --> 00:08:04.445
- Damn.
- Hey, just what's going on here?!

00:08:09.191 --> 00:08:11.819
That scar on your face...
Why, you're...!

00:08:23.072 --> 00:08:25.040
Damn. He got away.

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:27.334
Wow!

00:08:30.947 --> 00:08:33.973
Then I'll go and explain
what happened.

00:08:37.687 --> 00:08:39.814
They've discovered your whereabouts.

00:08:40.489 --> 00:08:44.425
There'll be a lot of visitors forcing
their way in to look around this evening.

00:08:45.895 --> 00:08:47.863
You can use my place.

00:08:49.065 --> 00:08:52.626
You don't want to cause trouble
where you're staying, do you?

00:08:52.902 --> 00:08:54.631
I'm very grateful.

00:08:55.237 --> 00:08:57.933
Since that's the case,
you'll be coming too, Shu.

00:08:59.608 --> 00:09:02.076
I'll send a note to your home.

00:09:02.979 --> 00:09:05.470
Wh-Wh-What's this supposed
to mean?!

00:09:05.548 --> 00:09:07.175
I'm so sorry.

00:09:07.249 --> 00:09:09.183
I was planning
to tell my daughter...

00:09:09.251 --> 00:09:12.311
...that Your Majesty would be
visiting after she got home.

00:09:13.923 --> 00:09:16.084
Talk about bad timing.

00:09:16.158 --> 00:09:18.092
Shall we give up
and go back to the palace?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.684
Shut up!

00:09:19.762 --> 00:09:22.287
For one thing,
just why are you guys here?!

00:09:22.465 --> 00:09:23.932
W-Well...!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.560
Obviously because
it looked like fun.

00:09:26.635 --> 00:09:29.195
I'm going to this residence.

00:09:29.605 --> 00:09:31.800
Who in the world
is this Ensei, anyway?

00:09:32.074 --> 00:09:34.474
He's an old friend of mine.

00:09:34.543 --> 00:09:36.534
He's been staying here.

00:09:36.612 --> 00:09:38.580
Now then, I'll also be going.

00:09:40.649 --> 00:09:44.085
If you're all coming as well,
please be sure to bring a sword.

00:09:44.453 --> 00:09:45.852
Why is that?

00:09:45.921 --> 00:09:48.719
The bandits that have made
their way here from Sa Province...

00:09:48.791 --> 00:09:50.691
...seem to be after a certain man.

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:53.991
Our guest has a very similar
distinguishing mark.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:57.258
No doubt he's been mistaken
for that person.

00:09:59.902 --> 00:10:03.303
Why am I stuck drinking tea
in a place like this?

00:10:04.206 --> 00:10:07.869
That's Secretary Kou for you.
It's a wonderful residence.

00:10:08.444 --> 00:10:11.880
No doubt your garden
is equally wonderful.

00:10:11.947 --> 00:10:14.507
Would you mind if I go
take a little walk?

00:10:14.884 --> 00:10:17.352
- Ensei!
- Do as you please.

00:10:18.387 --> 00:10:19.979
In that case...!

00:10:27.363 --> 00:10:29.331
This is really awkward.

00:10:29.832 --> 00:10:32.323
The promised one month
is almost over, isn't it?

00:10:33.736 --> 00:10:34.794
Y-Yes.

00:10:35.104 --> 00:10:37.664
Although I wasn't able
to be of much help.

00:10:39.508 --> 00:10:41.635
- That's too bad.
- Huh?

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:43.337
Did you just say something?

00:10:43.412 --> 00:10:44.811
No, nothing.

00:10:48.884 --> 00:10:51.284
So you came after all, Seiran.

00:10:51.353 --> 00:10:54.880
But I didn't expect you to bring
all these people with you.

00:10:55.191 --> 00:10:56.852
So you're Ensei?

00:10:56.926 --> 00:10:58.723
Oh? A new face?

00:10:58.794 --> 00:11:02.787
Just what do you have against us... er,
me, so as to interfere with my plans?!

00:11:02.865 --> 00:11:04.890
Ah, calm down, Your Majesty!

00:11:04.967 --> 00:11:06.229
Your Majesty?

00:11:07.336 --> 00:11:08.701
Oww!

00:11:08.771 --> 00:11:11.205
Oh, Assistant Secretary Ri.

00:11:12.041 --> 00:11:14.942
Sorry, but Princess and Secretary Kou
are over in that building there.

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:17.535
I'd appreciate it if you could
explain to them what's going on.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.245
I got it.

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.148
I'll go and see Shurei.

00:11:23.619 --> 00:11:26.315
And just why did you come here?

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.580
To help.

00:11:31.727 --> 00:11:33.354
They're here.

00:11:46.842 --> 00:11:50.005
Honestly!
I told you not to cause trouble!

00:11:52.414 --> 00:11:55.577
That's why I borrowed
this residence.

00:11:55.651 --> 00:11:57.642
But you've involved
her ladyship!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.813
We were seen together.

00:12:00.856 --> 00:12:03.324
There was a chance she'd be
taken as a hostage.

00:12:03.392 --> 00:12:05.587
For one thing, just who are you?!

00:12:05.661 --> 00:12:08.027
Ah, I was wondering about that too.

00:12:08.697 --> 00:12:10.995
Yeah. We'll talk about that...

00:12:12.635 --> 00:12:13.869
...later, okay?

00:12:13.869 --> 00:12:18.829
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:19.909 --> 00:12:21.638
What did you just say?

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.736
That the ones fighting in your garden
include Shoka Hong's retainer...

00:12:24.813 --> 00:12:30.479
...Seiran Si, the Left Urin Army general,
Shuei Ran, and also His Majesty.

00:12:33.822 --> 00:12:35.687
The stupid king.

00:12:35.758 --> 00:12:39.819
Shoka's daughter is in the room over
there. I advise you to go and see her.

00:12:40.663 --> 00:12:42.654
Secretary Kou. That girl...!

00:12:43.432 --> 00:12:47.163
Go. You're not the one
with whom that's to be discussed.

00:12:51.707 --> 00:12:53.834
- Assistant Secretary Ri.
- Yes?

00:12:53.909 --> 00:12:56.469
Those two were quite helpful.

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.045
I'm pleased to hear that.

00:13:02.384 --> 00:13:04.147
It seems like you're done.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.187
Yeah.

00:13:06.188 --> 00:13:07.678
What happened here?

00:13:08.557 --> 00:13:09.854
Shurei!

00:13:11.227 --> 00:13:13.218
What are you doing here?!

00:13:13.295 --> 00:13:14.557
What do you mean?

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:18.999
Just what's going on here?!
Oh, where's Ensei?

00:13:19.068 --> 00:13:21.468
Huh? Come to think of it...!

00:13:21.904 --> 00:13:25.203
How dare the one who caused
this entire mess run away!

00:13:25.741 --> 00:13:27.140
I haven't run away.

00:13:32.214 --> 00:13:34.409
- Who are you?
- It's me!

00:13:34.483 --> 00:13:37.384
I just shaved my beard
and cut my bangs.

00:13:37.519 --> 00:13:39.384
Ensei?!

00:13:40.322 --> 00:13:42.051
Wh-What?!

00:13:43.792 --> 00:13:45.419
Due to certain circumstances...

00:13:45.494 --> 00:13:47.894
...I sent my assistant to attend
Your Majesty's coronation...

00:13:47.963 --> 00:13:49.931
...so this is the first time we meet.

00:13:50.099 --> 00:13:52.659
I'm the Governor of
Sa Province, Ensei Ro.

00:13:52.735 --> 00:13:54.770
Sa Province's governor?!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:55.930
He's that...?

00:13:56.005 --> 00:13:57.666
Despite not
taking the National Exams...

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.038
...he was chosen to be head of
the provincial administration.

00:14:00.109 --> 00:14:02.202
He's the exception of exceptions.

00:14:02.278 --> 00:14:05.406
The National Exams?
Is that possible?

00:14:05.848 --> 00:14:08.908
And? What is Sa Province's
governor doing here?

00:14:08.984 --> 00:14:12.147
Are you aware of the Sa Clan's
history of trying to claim all...

00:14:12.221 --> 00:14:16.385
...regional power to avoid the central
imperial government's hold on them?

00:14:16.592 --> 00:14:20.551
But I heard that when Advisor Sa,
or Enjun Sa became head of the family...

00:14:20.629 --> 00:14:23.689
...he'd successfully settled the matter
within the family.

00:14:23.766 --> 00:14:25.734
For a while, yes.

00:14:26.001 --> 00:14:29.493
When Enjun was moved to Shi Province,
to the king's side...

00:14:30.105 --> 00:14:33.131
...he was no longer able to
watch over Sa Province.

00:14:33.208 --> 00:14:38.305
As a result, the Sa Family was able to
plot against the top provincial officials.

00:14:38.814 --> 00:14:41.681
Some were bought out and ended up
becoming puppet governments...

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.615
...while others were assassinated.

00:14:43.686 --> 00:14:45.415
No way!

00:14:45.487 --> 00:14:47.182
It's a terrible situation, isn't it?

00:14:47.256 --> 00:14:50.885
And as a result, no one wanted
to become head of the government.

00:14:50.959 --> 00:14:53.826
And so, Advisor Sa supposedly
said that someone...

00:14:53.896 --> 00:14:56.763
...who would be able to
defeat any assassin...

00:14:56.832 --> 00:14:58.800
...should be assigned
as governor.

00:14:59.601 --> 00:15:00.795
And that's you?

00:15:01.337 --> 00:15:02.998
That's right.

00:15:03.072 --> 00:15:05.836
Certainly, I have confidence
in my physical strength...

00:15:06.075 --> 00:15:09.602
...but I haven't passed the qualifying
exams, let alone the National Exams.

00:15:09.878 --> 00:15:12.813
So I was assigned the post
on a temporary basis.

00:15:12.881 --> 00:15:16.647
Temporary or not, Advisor Sa
perceived the matter correctly.

00:15:17.219 --> 00:15:19.779
The newly-appointed provincial governor
was able to fight off...

00:15:19.855 --> 00:15:22.915
...any assassin that tried to sneak in.
But that's not all.

00:15:22.991 --> 00:15:24.322
I've heard that his administration...

00:15:24.393 --> 00:15:26.020
...has also been excellent
with political matters.

00:15:26.095 --> 00:15:29.189
Granted, an extremely capable assistant
administrator was sent with him...

00:15:29.264 --> 00:15:31.596
...but he made
all the final decisions...

00:15:31.667 --> 00:15:34.727
...and showed everyone who the head
of the Sa Provincial Government is.

00:15:35.437 --> 00:15:38.600
On top of that, he completely ignored
any attempts by the Sa Clan...

00:15:38.674 --> 00:15:40.266
...to either bribe or
threaten him.

00:15:40.342 --> 00:15:42.537
Putting it that way
is a bit embarrassing.

00:15:43.879 --> 00:15:46.177
Now, let me get to the main issue.

00:15:46.248 --> 00:15:47.943
The reason I came to the capital...

00:15:48.016 --> 00:15:50.712
...is because I wanted to put these
in the king's keeping.

00:15:50.786 --> 00:15:54.586
These are the seal and badge
of the Governor of Sa Province.

00:15:55.324 --> 00:15:57.019
With the death of Enjun...

00:15:57.092 --> 00:15:59.959
...the Sa Family's started
to become very active again.

00:16:00.229 --> 00:16:02.220
If that's the case,
why did you come here?

00:16:02.297 --> 00:16:05.494
Right now, you need to be there
to suppress the Sa Clan.

00:16:05.567 --> 00:16:09.298
If I were truly able to declare myself
Governor of Sa Province...

00:16:09.371 --> 00:16:11.396
...I would've done so.
- What?

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:14.738
My sponsor, Enjun,
is no longer with us.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.573
Since I haven't passed
the National Exams...

00:16:16.645 --> 00:16:18.613
...all it takes is
for someone to state that...

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:21.376
...they won't accept me as a formal
official because of it.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.645
And that's why I came here.

00:16:23.719 --> 00:16:25.949
To see what sort of person
the new king is...

00:16:26.021 --> 00:16:28.489
...and what sort of people
he has with him.

00:16:28.557 --> 00:16:31.287
After I got a clear understanding of that,
I wanted to speak to him.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:33.658
Why were you being hunted
by the bandits?

00:16:33.729 --> 00:16:37.096
It seems that they put a price
on my head.

00:16:37.533 --> 00:16:41.162
I did cut down on my sleep time
to hunt the bandits, but...!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.201
Now I understand.

00:16:43.272 --> 00:16:45.263
I'll have a formal letter of authority
made for you immediately.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.707
I already told you.
I haven't passed the National Exams.

00:16:48.777 --> 00:16:50.972
There's no point
in repeating things.

00:16:51.613 --> 00:16:53.877
This is a good opportunity.
This time...

00:16:53.949 --> 00:16:58.249
...please assign a legitimate governor
that no one will be able to object to.

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:00.479
And what will you do?

00:17:00.556 --> 00:17:05.550
I'll return to Sa Province. There's a lot
I can do without being a governor.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:08.931
Ensei.

00:17:08.931 --> 00:17:10.899
- I have an order for you.
- Yes?

00:17:10.966 --> 00:17:12.934
At least pass
the qualifying exams.

00:17:13.001 --> 00:17:16.095
That way, I can assign you
to the post of lieutenant governor.

00:17:16.305 --> 00:17:18.967
There's already a very capable
lieutenant governor...

00:17:19.041 --> 00:17:20.975
...but I intend to take
the qualifying exams.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:24.946
Because it was my dream to become
an administrator of Sa Province.

00:17:25.581 --> 00:17:29.677
I'm beginning to feel that it'd be
all right to start all over again.

00:17:32.554 --> 00:17:35.717
Honestly, just why do
I have to cook at this time of night...

00:17:35.791 --> 00:17:37.452
...in someone else's home?

00:17:37.526 --> 00:17:41.292
I did send a letter that I'd be
coming for dinner today.

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.359
I didn't hear anything about it.

00:17:44.466 --> 00:17:47.094
Shurei, are you not happy
to see me?

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:52.131
Because of all the strange letters
and gifts you sent...

00:17:52.207 --> 00:17:55.301
...it doesn't feel like it's been so long
since we've seen each other...

00:17:55.644 --> 00:17:57.976
...but I am happy
to see you in person.

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:01.472
- Did you read my letters?
- I've been reading them.

00:18:01.984 --> 00:18:05.181
But using such expensive paper
to write a single line...

00:18:05.254 --> 00:18:09.350
Just what is "It rained today, so the carp
were happy." supposed to mean?

00:18:09.424 --> 00:18:13.087
Shuei said that the more faithfully
I wrote letters, the better.

00:18:13.395 --> 00:18:15.488
The content is
what's important.

00:18:15.998 --> 00:18:18.523
And the gifts?
How was the ice?

00:18:18.934 --> 00:18:21.664
We made shaved ice treats and
had it with all the kids.

00:18:21.737 --> 00:18:23.796
It was cool and delicious.

00:18:23.872 --> 00:18:27.205
And the eggs?
You said you liked them boiled.

00:18:27.276 --> 00:18:29.904
I shared them with the neighbors.
They were delicious.

00:18:30.245 --> 00:18:32.577
And the red flowers?
Weren't they beautiful?

00:18:32.648 --> 00:18:36.345
Yes. I'm pressing them
in some books.

00:18:36.718 --> 00:18:39.516
- And the voodoo doll?
- It's displayed in my room.

00:18:40.055 --> 00:18:42.819
Hey, is the voodoo doll a prank?

00:18:43.191 --> 00:18:46.683
His Majesty honestly believes
that it's a proper gift.

00:18:46.995 --> 00:18:49.793
Actually, I brought you
a gift today, too.

00:18:55.404 --> 00:18:56.598
This...!

00:18:56.672 --> 00:18:58.765
The sapling should arrive
as soon as tomorrow...

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:01.274
...but I thought I'd give you
a branch for now.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:04.707
You mentioned before that the cherry
trees in your garden no longer bloom.

00:19:09.384 --> 00:19:14.117
Thank you. I'm really happy.
This one's the best of them all.

00:19:14.189 --> 00:19:17.090
We'll plant that sapling and
I'll take care of it until someday...

00:19:17.192 --> 00:19:19.057
...it'll produce beautiful flowers.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.638
Is it just me or did
something absurd just happen?

00:19:38.313 --> 00:19:39.974
Ryuki.

00:19:40.048 --> 00:19:41.208
What is it?

00:19:41.283 --> 00:19:43.478
Be good and let me hit you!

00:19:43.719 --> 00:19:45.949
Wh-Why are you angry?

00:19:47.389 --> 00:19:50.324
Even if I explained,
no doubt you wouldn't understand!

00:19:50.392 --> 00:19:52.155
Come on,
you're not being reasonable.

00:19:52.227 --> 00:19:56.425
- You just might understand
after I hit you!
- Oh boy, those two never change.

00:19:56.765 --> 00:20:00.633
Hey, aren't you angry that he's
made a move on your dear Princess?

00:20:00.702 --> 00:20:02.829
It's nothing major.

00:20:02.904 --> 00:20:05.600
Besides, with this,
her ladyship will no longer cry...

00:20:05.674 --> 00:20:07.699
...when she looks at the garden.

00:20:07.776 --> 00:20:10.108
- Hey, let go!
- Give it up already, Ryuki!

00:20:13.915 --> 00:20:17.351
See you later then, Ryuki.
Behave yourself at the palace.

00:20:30.465 --> 00:20:33.400
Shurei. Would you be interested
in taking the National Exams?

00:20:34.903 --> 00:20:37.201
His majesty and I intend
to pass a bill...

00:20:37.272 --> 00:20:40.173
...allowing women to take
the National Exams within the year.

00:20:40.776 --> 00:20:44.769
But even if you pass, no doubt the path
you'll take will be extremely harsh.

00:20:44.846 --> 00:20:47.679
You might not be given any meaningful
work, your opinions could be ignored...

00:20:47.749 --> 00:20:49.808
...and you may be scorned
and ridiculed.

00:20:50.452 --> 00:20:53.649
You'll likely have to work very hard
all on your own.

00:20:54.156 --> 00:20:56.886
In spite of that, will you
take the National Exams?

00:20:59.795 --> 00:21:02.389
I'll do it. Please let me do it!

00:21:02.464 --> 00:21:04.659
I want to become an official!

00:21:05.834 --> 00:21:07.096
Good answer.

00:21:08.403 --> 00:21:10.871
Please provide me with guidance!

00:21:19.981 --> 00:21:23.382
Watch me, mother.
I'll do my best.

00:21:29.458 --> 00:21:31.688
Well then, Princess,
it's time to say goodbye.

00:21:32.627 --> 00:21:34.993
If you ever end up collapsing
by the roadside again...

00:21:35.063 --> 00:21:36.758
...do it in front of our place.

00:21:36.832 --> 00:21:38.732
Anywhere but, please.

00:21:39.167 --> 00:21:41.829
And here we're supposed to
be friends. How cold.

00:21:41.903 --> 00:21:45.270
And in comparison,
Princess is such a good girl.

00:21:45.874 --> 00:21:49.571
It'd be really interesting
if you became my superior.

00:21:51.413 --> 00:21:52.812
Never mind.

00:21:52.881 --> 00:21:55.247
The important thing is that you do
your best on the National Exams.

00:21:55.317 --> 00:21:57.217
I don't need you
to tell me that.

00:21:57.285 --> 00:21:59.753
They say that all good things come
to those who wait...

00:21:59.821 --> 00:22:02.119
...and this is truly a chance
that I've long been waiting for.

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:05.887
True. Well, Princess,
Seiran, take care.

00:22:12.067 --> 00:22:16.231
At the end of summer, a certain bill
was passed in court.

00:22:16.404 --> 00:22:19.032
It was for women to be given
the right to take the National Exams.

00:22:19.374 --> 00:22:21.865
Since the Senior Secretaries of
Civil Affairs and Finance...

00:22:21.943 --> 00:22:25.140
...who are rumored to be candidates
to become the next prime minister...

00:22:25.514 --> 00:22:29.245
...both gave their approval, all opposition
was overwhelmed and the bill passed.

00:22:33.455 --> 00:22:35.582
Thank you, Ryuki.

00:22:55.811 --> 00:23:01.272
Sho, you idiot. How dare you
try something this foolish?

00:23:02.284 --> 00:23:07.620
Enjun. Ever since you've left us,
things have been quite troubled here.

00:23:08.256 --> 00:23:10.417
Especially in Sa Province.

00:23:14.563 --> 00:23:16.895
Welcome back, my friend.

00:23:30.412 --> 00:23:35.509
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.717 --> 00:23:42.054
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.357 --> 00:23:47.317
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.529 --> 00:23:52.626
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.635 --> 00:23:58.038
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.574 --> 00:24:04.705
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:16.049
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:16.925 --> 00:24:22.522
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:22.931 --> 00:24:27.994
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.870 --> 00:24:34.433
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.809 --> 00:24:41.612
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:44.953 --> 00:24:45.476
Next Episode

00:24:45.553 --> 00:24:47.851
Next Episode
I'm sick in bed with a fever.

00:24:47.923 --> 00:24:48.389
Next Episode
There's No Medicine For Lovesickness

00:24:48.456 --> 00:24:53.553
Next Episode
There's No Medicine For Lovesickness
Father. Seiran. Huh?
Why Ryuki?

00:24:53.628 --> 00:24:53.923
Next Episode
There's No Medicine For Lovesickness

00:24:54.262 --> 00:24:57.095
Am I seeing illusions because
of the fever?
